sequenceDiagram
    title Webhook delivery and retry
    participant E as Event processor
    participant W as Merchant webhook
    participant S as Event store
    E->>W: Deliver event 42
    W->>S: Apply update and record event 42
    S-->>W: Committed
    alt Acknowledged
        W-->>E: 204 No Content
    else Response lost
        E->>W: Retry event 42
        W->>S: Check event 42
        S-->>W: Already processed
        W-->>E: 204 No Content
    end
